  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Territorial Connectivity and Integration of the Western Region of Paraguay: Bi-Oceanic Road</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de conectividad territorial e integracin de la regin occidental del Paraguay: Ruta Biocenica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a la conectividad y al acceso de la poblacin en la Regin Occidental de Paraguay (RO) a mercados productivos y servicios sociales y facilitar el comercio internacional en el rea de influencia del Corredor Biocenico (CB). Los objetivos especficos son: (i) mejorar la calidad del transporte vial en el tramo II del CB y el acceso este a Loma Plata; y (ii) facilitar la disponibilidad de flujos de ingreso para el mantenimiento del corredor intervenido.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to contribute to the accessibility of the population in the Western Region of Paraguay to productive markets and social services and to facilitate international trade in the area of influence of the Bioceanic Corridor. The specific objectives are: (i) to improve the quality of road transport along Section II of the Bioceanic Corridor and the eastern access to Loma Plata; and (ii) to facilitate the availability of revenue flows for the maintenance of the intervened corridor.</narrative>
  </description>
